{
    "title": "Flyers, Poster Maker, Design",
    "description": "<b>Create a flyer with the flyer maker app. No graphic design skills are needed. 20000+ flyer templates. Free, quick & easy to use.</b>\r\n\r\nWith Flyer Maker, creating cool flyers is super easy. Whether you're planning an event, having a sale, or promoting a product, our flyer-making app helps you design great-looking flyers in just a few minutes!\r\n\r\n<b>Why You'll Love Flyer Maker:</b>\r\n<b>Easy to Use:</b> You don't need any design skills. Just pick a template, add your text and images, and you're done!\r\n\r\n<b>Save Time & Money:</b> No need to hire a designer or learn complicated software. Make your flyers quickly and easily.\r\n\r\n<b>Lots of Templates With Realistc Content:</b> Choose from over 20,000 templates for any occasion. Whether it's for business or fun, we have what you need.\r\n\r\n<b>Fully Customizable:</b> Change colors, fonts, and images to make your flyer just the way you want it.\r\n\r\n<b>High-Quality Results:</b> Your flyers will look great whether you print them or share them online.\r\n\r\n<b>Share with Ease:</b> Post your flyers on social media, print them out, or send them by email\u2014all from the app.\r\n\r\n<b>Who Is Flyer Maker For?</b>\r\nFlyer Maker is perfect for anyone who needs to make flyers quickly and easily. Whether you're a small business owner, a marketer, or just someone planning a party, our app helps you create professional-looking flyers without the hassle.\r\n\r\nWith this flyer-making app, you can create an event flyer, birthday flyer, party flyer, educational flyer, real estate flyer, festival flyers, church flyer, DJ flyer, typography poster, restaurant menu, discount flyers, concert flyer, grocery flyers, hotel flyers, fitness posters, tutoring flyers,  grand openings flyers, fundraisers flyers, open house flyers, restaurant flyers, health and wellness flyers, fitness flyers, spa flyers, education flyers, back to school flyers, tutoring flyers, holiday and seasonal flyers and more.\r\n\r\n<b>Get Started Today!</b>\r\n\r\nReady to make awesome flyers? Download Flyer Maker now and start designing in minutes. It's fast, easy, and fun!\r\n\r\nFlyer Maker offers monthly, six-monthly, or annual premium subscriptions to unlock all of the features.\r\n\u2022 Remove ads\r\n\u2022 Access to all premium graphics including flyer template.\r\n\r\nSubscription Details:\r\nPayment for flyer maker will be charged to your Google Play Account at confirmation of purchase. Your flyer maker subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off within your Google Play Account at least 24-hours before the end of the current subscription billing period.\r\n\r\n<b>Please rate the flyer maker app, and give your feedback to help us improve.</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Create a flyer with the flyer maker app. No graphic design skills are needed. 20000+ flyer templates. Free, quick &amp; easy to use.</b><br><br>With Flyer Maker, creating cool flyers is super easy. Whether you&#39;re planning an event, having a sale, or promoting a product, our flyer-making app helps you design great-looking flyers in just a few minutes!<br><br><b>Why You&#39;ll Love Flyer Maker:</b><br><b>Easy to Use:</b> You don&#39;t need any design skills. Just pick a template, add your text and images, and you&#39;re done!<br><br><b>Save Time &amp; Money:</b> No need to hire a designer or learn complicated software. Make your flyers quickly and easily.<br><br><b>Lots of Templates With Realistc Content:</b> Choose from over 20,000 templates for any occasion. Whether it&#39;s for business or fun, we have what you need.<br><br><b>Fully Customizable:</b> Change colors, fonts, and images to make your flyer just the way you want it.<br><br><b>High-Quality Results:</b> Your flyers will look great whether you print them or share them online.<br><br><b>Share with Ease:</b> Post your flyers on social media, print them out, or send them by email\u2014all from the app.<br><br><b>Who Is Flyer Maker For?</b><br>Flyer Maker is perfect for anyone who needs to make flyers quickly and easily. Whether you&#39;re a small business owner, a marketer, or just someone planning a party, our app helps you create professional-looking flyers without the hassle.<br><br>With this flyer-making app, you can create an event flyer, birthday flyer, party flyer, educational flyer, real estate flyer, festival flyers, church flyer, DJ flyer, typography poster, restaurant menu, discount flyers, concert flyer, grocery flyers, hotel flyers, fitness posters, tutoring flyers,  grand openings flyers, fundraisers flyers, open house flyers, restaurant flyers, health and wellness flyers, fitness flyers, spa flyers, education flyers, back to school flyers, tutoring flyers, holiday and seasonal flyers and more.<br><br><b>Get Started Today!</b><br><br>Ready to make awesome flyers? Download Flyer Maker now and start designing in minutes. It&#39;s fast, easy, and fun!<br><br>Flyer Maker offers monthly, six-monthly, or annual premium subscriptions to unlock all of the features.<br>\u2022 Remove ads<br>\u2022 Access to all premium graphics including flyer template.<br><br>Subscription Details:<br>Payment for flyer maker will be charged to your Google Play Account at confirmation of purchase. Your flyer maker subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off within your Google Play Account at least 24-hours before the end of the current subscription billing period.<br><br><b>Please rate the flyer maker app, and give your feedback to help us improve.</b>",
